== Trivia ==
* This item is implied to be the damaged eye of {{C|Cain}} beneath his eyepatch.
* Rather than deciding a random input when a tear is fired, the [[familiar]] will rapidly switch the direction it's facing at all times.
** This effect is visible with {{c|The Forgotten}}, {{c|Tainted Forgotten}}, and other characters under the effects of {{I|Berserk!}}.

